alled the reporters?"}, {"q": "Nie ____ mnie!", "options": ["powiedziała", "obwiniaj", "machał"], "answer": 1, "exp": "Nie obwiniaj mnie! — Не звинувачуй мене!", "exp_pl": "Nie obwiniaj mnie! — Don't blame me!", "exp_en": "Nie obwiniaj mnie! — Don't blame me!", "tag": "Репліка", "tag_pl": "Kwestia", "tag_en": "Line", "tr": "Не звинувачуй мене!", "tr_pl": "Don't blame me!", "tr_en": "Don't blame me!"}, {"q": "Doc ____.", "options": ["milczy", "macha", "sami"], "answer": 0, "exp": "Doc milczy. — Док мовчить.", "exp_pl": "Doc milczy. — Doc is silent.", "exp_en": "Doc milczy. — Doc is silent.", "tag": "Репліка", "tag_pl": "Kwestia", "tag_en": "Line", "tr": "Док мовчить.", "tr_pl": "Doc is silent.", "tr_en": "Doc is silent."}, {"q": "To był ____.", "options": ["zadzwonił", "błąd", "milczy"], "answer": 1, "exp": "To był błąd. — Це була помилка.", "exp_pl": "To był błąd. — It was a mistake.", "exp_en": "To był błąd. — It was a mistake.", "tag": "Репліка", "tag_pl": "Kwestia", "tag_en": "Line", "tr": "Це була помилка.", "tr_pl": "It was a mistake.", "tr_en": "It was a mistake."}, {"q": "____ za nim.", "options": ["Tęsknimy", "sami", "Nagle"], "answer": 0, "exp": "Tęsknimy za nim. — Ми сумуємо за ним.", "exp_pl": "Tęsknimy za nim. — We miss him.", "exp_en": "Tęsknimy za nim. — We miss him.", "tag": "Репліка", "tag_pl": "Kwestia", "tag_en": "Line", "tr": "Ми сумуємо за ним.", "tr_pl": "We miss him.", "tr_en": "We miss him."}, {"q": "Znowu ____.", "options": ["obwiniaj", "mikrofony", "sami"], "answer": 2, "exp": "Znowu sami. — Знову самі.", "exp_pl": "Znowu sami. — Alone again.", "exp_en": "Znowu sami. — Alone again.", "tag": "Репліка", "tag_pl": "Kwestia", "tag_en": "Line", "tr": "Знову самі.", "tr_pl": "Alone again.", "tr_en": "Alone again."}], "label": "СЦЕНА 3 · ХТО ПОДЗВОНИВ?", "label_pl": "SCENA 3 · KTO ZADZWONIŁ?", "label_en": "SCENE 3 · WHO CALLED?", "q": "Ти на головній вулиці серед репортерів.", "q_pl": "Jesteś na głównej ulicy wśród reporterów.", "q_en": "You are on